          "git_sha": "f255f28b901a0b5d079e1ed6da3ee7556ba0651b",
          "line_end": 29,
          "line_start": 25,
          "path": "docs/architecture.md",
          "repository": "sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks",
          "url": "https://github.com/sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks/blob/9efefedd249ee23c48608070978dd1a08a3be1ff/docs/architecture.md#L25-L29"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_242364530e388e978870fb0a770207f906a0651cd08fa23a67784981c5ad850a"
      ],
      "text": "The Cedar policy engine combines guardrail signals with entity state from a Turso (SQLite) local store and returns Allow, Deny, or Escalate adjudications back through the hook adapter."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_bf8497c681173ea7473cce5d7575717ec448844610374f088825240865108883",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
