          "git_sha": "f255f28b901a0b5d079e1ed6da3ee7556ba0651b",
          "line_end": 8,
          "line_start": 5,
          "path": "docs/architecture.md",
          "repository": "sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks",
          "url": "https://github.com/sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks/blob/9efefedd249ee23c48608070978dd1a08a3be1ff/docs/architecture.md#L5-L8"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a46e8694975fcfe5bf1e049910bc2f8f2fac870caed0489d1044b588c6ea3b38"
      ],
      "text": "Hook adapters speak stdin/stdout JSON with each agent, normalize the payload, and forward it over gRPC to `sondera serve` on loopback TCP, 127.0.0.1:50051 by default."
    },
    {
