        "slc_fe93b7044cc9006bdd9fa003afef7c7dd5c6ecab2fe32836c4bd96cde79b5350"
      ],
      "text": "Agent-specific tool names normalize to shared event types (Claude's Bash, Cursor's shell hook, Copilot's and Gemini's bash all become ShellCommand), so one Cedar rule set governs every supported agent."
    },
