        "slc_e658a44b257aaa904ed20d72efcdaa05e24daa93e5cc9404ddddc5d503ed315b"
      ],
      "text": "Agent execution is modeled as a trajectory of typed events in four categories: Action (pre-execution), Observation (post-execution), Control (lifecycle), and State (environment snapshots)."
    },
