        "slc_bf1c8ce2da66daae85354fd595cc333f34ee516dfe097981ef1bd1e30aae13c8"
      ],
      "text": "Enforcement hooks fail closed: a hook that cannot reach the harness denies preventive events and never proceeds unadjudicated, so losing the server blocks the agent rather than ungoverning it."
    },
