        "slc_c68ea742b60e51971e9282d50d0fc526bad5d72ad892008024d466b786ed1758"
      ],
      "text": "The optional LLM classifiers fail open when disabled, erroring, or slower than the adjudication budget — to compliant with no violations and to Public — so Cedar and the deterministic policies still decide."
    },
